mshv: Initialize local variables early upon region invalidation

jira KERNEL-1029
Rebuild_History Non-Buildable kernel-6.12.0-211.7.1.el10_2
commit-author Stanislav Kinsburskii <skinsburskii@linux.microsoft.com>
commit beb15a6036fecbdc23191f09e4cd57558b0db508
Empty-Commit: Cherry-Pick Conflicts during history rebuild.
Will be included in final tarball splat. Ref for failed cherry-pick at:
ciq/ciq_backports/kernel-6.12.0-211.7.1.el10_2/beb15a60.failed

Ensure local variables are initialized before use so that the warning can
print the right values if locking the region to invalidate fails due to
inability to lock the region.

	Reported-by: Dan Carpenter <dan.carpenter@linaro.org>
